OL,3,GNEWSAPolice now using scrapped Clean
OL,4,AAir Zone cameras
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have been catching criminals by
OL,7,Fusing cameras installed as part of an
OL,8,Fabandoned Clean Air Zone scheme.
OL,10,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) took
OL,11,Fcontrol of about 400 automatic number
OL,12,Fplate recognition (ANPR) cameras that
OL,13,Fwere supposed to be used to enforce the
OL,14,Fplanned region-wide low-emission zone.
OL,16,FAnd they have been used to make
OL,17,F"multiple arrests", a senior officer
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
