OL,3,GNEWSAPolice now using scrapped Clean
OL,4,AAir Zone cameras
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cameras were installed as part of
OL,7,FGreater Manchester's drive to cut the
OL,8,Fnumber of high-emission vehicles on the
OL,9,Fregions roads, but the plans were
OL,10,Fdropped in favour of other efforts to
OL,11,Fmake the region's transport network
OL,12,Fmore environmentally friendly.
